; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on XAUUSD - best trailing of M10: ATRentry trailing (TrailMode 1), setup 1 of 4: both, session 1200-2000 server time, trend filter M30 EMA 200, target 1.5R. DO NOT LOAD ON BTC.
; Trailing: 1.5 x ATR(14) of M10 at entry behind the best price once the profit reaches 1 x ATR, stop moved once per closed minute. Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 1, TrailParam 0).
; Same setup as Loma_T15_Gold_M10_ATRentry_1of4_Both_1200-2000_M30 in Loma_XAUUSD_v1_35.zip (only the magic number and the trade comment differ): run one or the other, not both. Its Loma_T15 header gives the one-minute backtest's figures; the replay's are here.
; Picked on 1 Jan 2025 - 15 May 2026 only, by the one-minute backtest at the study's costs (FTMO spread, no commission; score 1.54): 100 trades, PF 1.72. Replay of the same months: 98 trades, PF 1.43.
; TICK REPLAY (every Dukascopy tick, the EA's rules; VT costs: VT's 0.15 spread scaled by Dukascopy's own spread, 0.60 USD commission per ounce). 16 May - 13 Nov 2026 (the trailing was chosen on these months): this setup 44 trades, PF 2.05, net +7.9R (stressed PF 1.75); the 4 setups of M10 + ATRentry together 203 trades, PF 1.57, net +27.9R (stressed 1.38).
; ATRentry trailing with its own setups was chosen as the best on M10 (highest PF of the EA's trailing systems with 100+ trades in those months; each system has its own setups), so the 2026 figure is the score it was chosen by, not a test.
; EARLIER DATA, not used for any choice (same replay and costs): this setup: 15 Jul - 31 Dec 2024, 29 trades, PF 0.59. The 4 setups together: 15 Jul - 31 Dec 2024, 154 trades, PF 0.58. They did not hold (under 1.3): UNPROVEN, Strategy Tester and demo only.
; Needs a spread near VT's 0.15 USD: at Dukascopy's own wider spreads the 4 setups took 106 of the 203 trades in those months, PF 1.21.
; Data: Dukascopy XAUUSD ticks, broker server time. Commission is in the figures: set CommissionPerLot to your round-trip commission per lot.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter is on: on demo or live the EA skips entries within 30 minutes of high-impact USD news, which the replay did not do (no effect in the Strategy Tester). Set it to false to trade exactly what was replayed.
